      "text": "User\n |\n v\nPrimary ✓\n\nResponse Sent\n\nLater\n |\n v\nReplica 1\nReplica 2\n\n✓ Fast Writes\n✓ Low Latency\n✓ Better User Experience\n\n❌ Replication Lag\n❌ Possible Data Loss",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User\n |\n v\nPrimary ✓\n\nResponse Sent\n\nLater\n |\n v\nReplica 1\nReplica 2\n\n✓ Fast Writes\n✓ Low Latency\n✓ Better User Experience\n\n❌ Replication Lag\n❌ Possible Data Loss",
